  "description": "TUnit-native fluent log-assertion DSL using [AssertionExtension] over Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Testing.FakeLogCollector. Provides Assert.That(collector).HasLogged()/HasNotLogged() with filter and terminator chaining; emits captured-records snapshot in failure messages.",
  "id": "LogAssertions.TUnit",
